{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、名古屋のマンモスフリーマーケットでライブをさせていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6241539/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6241539/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた方、ほんとうにありがとう( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6241539/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はアンダー曲、「春のメロディー」を初披露させていただきましてヽ(^ω^)ﾉわふわふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでしたかね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6241539/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐるカー的な、王道の乃木坂っぽい曲です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二番目は金管鼓笛隊みたいにいっぱい移動します!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サビでは後ろ向いて踊ってくるっと振り返ったりして\n今までとはちょっと違うダンスで可愛いですよー(´>ω<｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6241539/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装も可愛くて、ゆったんも言ってるけどレアな緑ー♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CD発売、楽しみにしててね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6241539/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6241539/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日きてくださった皆さん全員、メンバーのことみえましたかね?(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に遠くて...っていうのはしょうがない部分もあるかもしれないんですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前の方にいたのに見れなかったって方もいるかもしれません(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さいお子さんも、\n女性の方も、\nたまたま来ていたおばあちゃんおじいちゃんも、\n身体が弱い方も、\nみんなで盛り上がってほしいんです。\n安全に、楽しくやってきたいんですヽ(^ω^)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして次のイベントでは、\n来てくださった皆さんが笑顔で楽しめるようなステージを創りましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6241539/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たち含めみんなでマナーを守って、終わったあともまた来たい!って思えるような\n気持ちのよいイベントを創り上げたいです( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむめいとの皆さん、ご協力の程よろしくお願いします。♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とゆことで\n明日もがんばる！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しむ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみこ最後だから泣かないようにがんばる！！！(´;ω;`)ぶわぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も、楽しみにしてます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/6241539/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text